0..79 Comment "//! The checker refuses the composite law on terms of a category with families."
80..118 Comment "//! Huang and Angiuli state these laws"
119..195 Comment "//! [Huang-2026-fat_cell_structures_generalized_algebraic_theories], § 1.1."
196..199 Comment "//!"
200..276 Comment "//! Two substitutions in turn move a term as their composite does. The outer"
277..356 Comment "//! substitution\'s type index applies `subTy`, which the composite law on types"
357..435 Comment "//! rewrites. A step inside that index meets a peak that the decision does not"
436..449 Comment "//! join yet."
450..453 Comment "//!"
454..529 Comment "//! Each index carries the indices of the operation it applies, and the two"
530..608 Comment "//! sorts agree modulo the composite law on types. The checker refuses the law"
609..639 Comment "//! by name before it decides."
640..643 Comment "//!"
644..660 Comment "//! - see: #5042"
661..677 Comment "//! - see: #5117"
678..754 Comment "//! - cites: [Huang-2026-fat_cell_structures_generalized_algebraic_theories]"
